    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014Your strategy is your ultimate trump card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When 3D strategy collides with probability metaphysics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dice roll is a heart - pounding moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it be a desperate comeback or a total defeat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mysterious tower that has swallowed countless adventurers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the perfect combination of wits and luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can help you break through layers of deadly traps!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Dice - Gambling Mechanism</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five basic dice faces, hundreds of equipment combinations, and dozens of relic effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep - Thinking Strategy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a life - or - death decision. The &quot;undo&quot; button is like a magic eraser for regrets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysterious Tower Random Events</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor holds unexpected crises and treasures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Battle Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic battles of wits unfold on the dark slate floors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your destined squad:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brute - force output team? A steady - defense team? Or a lucky - gambler team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is a life - and - death gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to take on the ultimate test of the mysterious tower?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014Your strategy is your ultimate trump card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When 3D strategy collides with probability metaphysics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dice roll is a heart - pounding moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it be a desperate comeback or a total defeat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mysterious tower that has swallowed countless adventurers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the perfect combination of wits and luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can help you break through layers of deadly traps!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Dice - Gambling Mechanism</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five basic dice faces, hundreds of equipment combinations, and dozens of relic effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep - Thinking Strategy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a life - or - death decision. The &quot;undo&quot; button is like a magic eraser for regrets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysterious Tower Random Events</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor holds unexpected crises and treasures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Battle Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic battles of wits unfold on the dark slate floors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your destined squad:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brute - force output team? A steady - defense team? Or a lucky - gambler team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is a life - and - death gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to take on the ultimate test of the mysterious tower?</p>",
